# Renovo CODEOWNERS
#
# Maps paths to the people GitHub asks for review on pull requests. Together with the `main`
# branch protection rule "Require review from Code Owners", only the listed owners' approvals
# satisfy the required-approval gate.
#
# Pattern matching follows the same rules as .gitignore. Later entries take precedence over
# earlier ones.
#
# See:
# https://docs.github.com/articles/about-code-owners

